 of old (those in myth and legend anyway).<br /> <br /> That said while at this time I have no other ideas on new Talent Gifts I will say that if you wrote this I would buy it because more Talent Gifts, really more powers in general, is always a good thing and such.</div> </div> </div> </div>At this point I want to say in the established genres of TC Core, Aeon, and Aberrant, but I will absolutely revisit the topic after we see further out there settings like Aegis.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}